---
// Homepage: one sentence on what Archetype is, then a door per audience.
// Uses the global --f-* tokens from theme.css, which switch with Starlight's
// [data-theme]. Rendered inside a `template: splash` page.
---

<div class="home">
  <section class="hero shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Open software for palaeography</p>
    <h1>Read the hands of the past.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Archetype helps scholars search, study and compare historical handwriting, using manuscript images and the texts they carry.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn primary" href="https://beta.archetype-pal.ink">Try the live corpus <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/about/">What is Archetype?</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell">
    <h2 class="doors-h">I am a&hellip;</h2>
    <div class="doors">
      <a class="door" href="/researchers/">
        <h3>Researcher</h3>
        <p>Use Archetype in your work, on our live corpus or your own manuscripts.</p>
        <span class="go">Start here <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="door" href="/contributors/">
        <h3>Contributor</h3>
        <p>Install and run Archetype, and help develop it.</p>
        <span class="go">Start here <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
      <a class="door" href="/funders/">
        <h3>Funder</h3>
        <p>See what already works, who it serves, and where funding would help.</p>
        <span class="go">Start here <span class="arw">&rarr;</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell">
    <p class="note">Live today: 710 charters, 3,000 page images and 12,700 annotated letter-forms from <em>Models of Authority</em>, the Scottish royal charters of 1100&ndash;1250.</p>
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .home { color: var(--f-text); font-family: var(--sl-font); line-height: 1.6; padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); }
  .home .shell { max-width: 1080px; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); }
  .home > * + *, .home .doors > *, .home .door > * { margin-top: 0; }
  .home a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
  .home h1, .home h2, .home h3 { font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.012em; margin: 0; text-wrap: balance; }

  .home .eyebrow { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.19em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--f-dim); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; margin: 0 0 1.2rem; }
  .home .eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 24px; height: 2px; background: var(--f-accent); margin-right: 0.7rem; flex: none; }

  .home .hero { padding-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem); padding-bottom: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.4rem); }
  .home .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6.4vw, 4.6rem); line-height: 1.02; max-width: 14ch; }
  .home .hero .lead { max-width: 46ch; color: var(--f-muted); font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.6vw, 1.3rem); margin: 1.4rem 0 0; font-family: var(--sl-font-headings); line-height: 1.5; }
  .home .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.7rem; margin-top: 2rem; }

  .home .btn { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.94rem; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.72rem 1.2rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid transparent; transition: background 0.16s, border-color 0.16s, color 0.16s; }
  .home .btn.primary { background: var(--f-btn-bg); color: var(--f-btn-fg); }
  .home .btn.primary:hover { background: var(--f-btn-bg-hi); }
  .home .btn.ghost { border-color: var(--f-border-strong); color: var(--f-text); }
  .home .btn.ghost:hover { border-color: var(--f-accent); color: var(--f-accent); }

  .home .doors-h { font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem); margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }
  .home .doors { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
  .home .door { background: var(--f-surface); border: 1px solid var(--f-border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.6rem; box-shadow: var(--f-shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s; }
  .home .door:hover { border-color: var(--f-accent); box-shadow: var(--f-shadow-lift); }
  .home .door h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .home .door p { color: var(--f-muted); font-size: 0.97rem; margin: 0; flex: 1; }
  .home .door .go { color: var(--f-accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem; display: inline-flex; gap: 0.45rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 0.4rem; }

  .home .arw { transition: transform 0.18s; }
  .home .btn:hover .arw, .home .door:hover .arw { transform: translateX(3px); }

  .home .note { color: var(--f-dim); font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 2.2rem 0 0; max-width: 70ch; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .home .doors { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .home .btn:hover .arw, .home .door:hover .arw { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
